                      "color": "#1E3A5F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": ": the bar is sales so far, the navy tick is target to date. The darker band ends at 90% of target. Green means at or above target, amber within 5%, red further behind.",
