                      "color": "#1E3A5F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": ": Ramping = open less than 12 months. Declining ≤ −10% YoY. Slipping −3% to −10%. Steady ±3%. Growing ≥ +3%.",
